# No SPA catch-all.
#
# This app uses hash routes (/#/app, /#/privacy), so only "/" needs index.html.
# A /* → /index.html rewrite made every unknown path a soft-duplicate of the
# homepage (same HTML + homepage canonical → GSC "Alternative page with proper
# canonical tag").
#
# Host consolidations (www / pages.dev → apex) and path→hash redirects live in
# functions/_middleware.js — Cloudflare Pages does not support domain-level
# rules in this file.
#
# Trailing-slash normalization for directories (e.g. /how-much-have-i-spent-on-amazon
# → /how-much-have-i-spent-on-amazon/) is handled automatically by Cloudflare
# and is expected to appear once as "Page with redirect" until Google drops it.
